{"id":"n38163-1-9","stage":3,"title":"꼭대기 · 顶","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38163-1-9-1","ko":"넌 등산을 왜 좋아해?","zh":"你为什么喜欢爬山呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"등산을","meaning":"登山","explanation":"등산：登山；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"등산","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40293","senseId":"2","lemma":"등산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등산을","audio":"/audio/abe767043d9f11e77824.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아해?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아해","audio":"/audio/ef5074f85cc0a689d2ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ae5010e03333d4ba","term":"등산","zh":"登山","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3","entryId":"40293","definition":"以运动或玩乐为目的的爬山。","pronunciation":["등산"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e94e5f19339cb7a1bf5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38163-1-9-2","ko":"산에 올라 꼭대기에서 풍경을 바라보면 답답한 마음이 사라지거든.","zh":"因为只要登上山顶眺望风景，郁闷的心情就会消失。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"산에","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산에","audio":"/audio/e15e1da2e3c81b9f81cf.mp3"}},{"text":"올라","meaning":"上，登，攀登","explanation":"오르다：上，登，攀登；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"1","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올라","audio":"/audio/3ca724409b9116eb46fd.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭대기에서","meaning":"顶，巅","explanation":"꼭대기：顶，巅；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"꼭대기","audio":"/audio/f8de6a426c4eea22fabf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38163","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭대기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭대기에서","audio":"/audio/e468ad0d6484a482fbfd.mp3"}},{"text":"풍경을","meaning":"风景，风光，景色，景致","explanation":"풍경：风景，风光，景色，景致；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"1","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풍경을","audio":"/audio/27c8d9b97612618ca24d.mp3"}},{"text":"바라보면","meaning":"望，看","explanation":"바라보다：望，看；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"바라보다","audio":"/audio/c09f5b5d3ee043cc11f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64743","senseId":"1","lemma":"바라보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바라보면","audio":"/audio/2ad93969e23a629e70bb.mp3"}},{"text":"답답한","meaning":"烦闷，堵得慌，发闷","explanation":"답답하다：烦闷，堵得慌，发闷；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"답답하다","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49437","senseId":"1","lemma":"답답하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"답답한","audio":"/audio/85f33f433114a0d8e4b3.mp3"}},{"text":"마음이","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음이","audio":"/audio/82961fdb31e01cd27c53.mp3"}},{"text":"사라지거든.","meaning":"消失，消灭，泯灭","explanation":"사라지다：消失，消灭，泯灭；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"사라지다","audio":"/audio/f09c93279df41f2fa711.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66643","senseId":"2","lemma":"사라지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사라지거든","audio":"/audio/969278502cccd83ab2fb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上，登，攀登","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"人、动物等从低的地方移动到高的地方或从下往上移动。","pronunciation":["오르다"]},{"id":"f8de6a426c4eea22","term":"꼭대기","zh":"顶，巅","audio":"/audio/f8de6a426c4eea22fabf.mp3","entryId":"38163","definition":"树立的物体的最上端。","pronunciation":["꼭때기"]},{"id":"64d560d21687616f","term":"풍경","zh":"风景，风光，景色，景致","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3","entryId":"72392","definition":"大自然或某一地区的美景。","pronunciation":["풍경"]},{"id":"c09f5b5d3ee043cc","term":"바라보다","zh":"望，看","audio":"/audio/c09f5b5d3ee043cc11f8.mp3","entryId":"64743","definition":"正对着看。","pronunciation":["바라보다"]},{"id":"303de431f55bd88a","term":"답답하다","zh":"烦闷，堵得慌，发闷","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3","entryId":"49437","definition":"像要窒息或难以呼吸。","pronunciation":["답따파다"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心情